= Hoover Moratorium

In light of the current economic situation, and the German banking crisis, President Herbert Hoover of the United States has issued a moratorium on war debt payments from the Great War, including Germany's. Our budget situation should improve somewhat.

[? if sfio_in_government and foreign_minister_party == "SFIO": Even though this is not our accomplishment, our foreign ministry is eager to take credit for this accomplishment. ?][? if not sfio_in_government and foreign_minister_party != "SFIO": Even though this is not the work of the foreign ministry, it is eager to take credit for this accomplishment. ?]

